<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page journal-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/blog'>Project journal</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">case study <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1>MBK Global: a home for creative digital work</h1><p class="article-deck">A brand direction that brings web experiences, design thinking and technology experiments under one identity.</p></section>
<div class="academy-reading-layout"><aside class="academy-toc"><p class="academy-kicker">IN THIS PROJECT</p><nav aria-label="On this page"><a href="#main-content">Project overview</a></nav><div class="academy-author"><img src="/assets/images/mbk-personal-favicon-96.png" width="38" height="38" alt=""><div>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Founder, MBK Global</small></div></div><p class="academy-read-note">2 min read · Practical learning notes<br>Learn. Apply. Make it your own.</p><a class='academy-text-link' href='/resources'>More learning resources ↗</a></aside><div class="academy-reading-body"><p class="eyebrow">MBK JOURNAL / ARTICLE</p><p class="article-link"><a href='/blog'>← All articles</a></p><article class="journal-article" id="mbk-global"><div class="article-index">02 <span>BRAND</span></div><div class="article-body"><p class="article-kicker">THE DIGITAL STUDIO IDEA</p><p>MBK Global represents the broader digital side of my work: websites, online experiences, creative concepts and experiments with emerging tools. The intention is to keep the brand flexible enough to explore different ideas while keeping one consistent standard—clear communication and thoughtful execution.</p><p>Good digital work is not only about adding effects or making a page look impressive. It should help people understand what is offered, find what they need and take the next step without friction. That means content hierarchy, accessibility, performance and responsive behaviour matter just as much as visual style.</p><p>As the projects grow, MBK Global can serve as a shared home for selected work and experiments. The brand is evolving alongside my skills, and this journal will help document that process.</p><p><a class="article-link" href="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Visit MBK Global ↗</a></p><div class="article-meta">MBK GLOBAL · BRAND NOTES</div></div></article><p class="article-link"><a href='/blog'>Back to the MBK journal ↗</a></p><section aria-label="Related MBK portfolio pages" class="mbk-related-links"><h2>Explore related MBK pages</h2><p>Continue exploring Bakhtawar Khan (MBK), MBK Global projects and practical digital technology resources.</p><ul><li><a href="/">Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global — Web Development, AI &amp; Digital Technology</a></li><li><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global</a></li><li><a href='/projects'>Projects by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/services'>Web Development, AI, APIs &amp; SEO Services | Bakhtawar Khan</a></li><li><a href='/resources'>Web Development, API, SEO &amp; Accessibility Resources | MBK</a></li><li><a href='/blog'>Articles &amp; Guides by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/official-links'>Official Links &amp; Projects</a></li><li><a href='/contact'>Contact Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/web-development'>Web Development Services</a></li><li><a href='/digital-branding'>Digital Branding &amp; Portfolio Presence</a></li><li><a href='/personal-branding-and-online-identity'>Building a Consistent Personal Brand Online | Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/content-strategy-and-search-intent'>Writing Useful Website Content | Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li></ul></section></div></div><div data-portrait-track data-caption="The person behind the work"></div></main><script src="assets/js/script.js"></script><footer class="academy-footer"><div><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><p>Thoughtful technology. Useful knowledge. Work in progress.</p></div><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/official-links'>Official links</a><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/resume'>Resume</a><a href='/faq'>FAQ</a><a href='/privacy-policy'>Privacy</a></nav><div class="academy-colophon"><span>© 2026 Bakhtawar Khan · MBK Global</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer><script